Rejected: the paper supports generation and exact verification, but no reviewed family satisfies hardness on Track A or B.

The decisive measurement is the retained automorphism-recovery prototype: a unit-anchor normalization solves 8/8 shipping instances, trying at most 12 multipliers and using at most 43 modular operations. This is shorter than the proposed 40-operation-median/247-operation-bound compact route. The paper’s direct HCS constructions are likewise explicit output-linear formulas, so they provide no Track B compression gap. See the [full paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1504.07369).

